      'or': '- Free medical check-up, medicines, and diagnostic services for enrolled children.',
      'as': '- Free medical check-up, medicines, and diagnostic services for enrolled children.',
      'ur': '- Free medical check-up, medicines, and diagnostic services for enrolled children.',
